<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ page.url }} — Fansite</title>
<style>
 body{margin:0;font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Arial,sans-serif;background: #f4f4f4;
 header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,{{ village_accent | default('#6a2ca0', true) }},{{ village_accent | default('#b0349a', true) }});padding:22px 26px;text-align:center;filter:saturate(1.3)}
 header h1{margin:0;font-size:1.7rem;text-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
 .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 20px}
 .post{background: #fff;
 .post h2{margin:0 0 6px;color: #333;
 .post .meta{color: #0366d6;
 .tags span{display:inline-block;background: #f4f4f4;
 .blogroll a{color: #0366d6;
 .spotlight{border-color:{{ village_accent | default('#8b3fd1', true) }}}
 .spotlight h3{margin:10px 0 4px;color: #333;
 .spotlight ul{margin:2px 0 8px;padding-left:20px;font-size:.82rem;color: #333;
 .spotlight .quote{margin:4px 0 10px;padding-left:10px;border-left:2px solid
 footer{text-align:center;color: #666;
</style></head>
<body>
<header><h1>✨ {{ page.url }} ✨</h1><div style="color:#f0d6ff;font-size:.85rem">{{ page.village }} &middot; {{ page.category }} fan community</div></header>
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="post"><h2>Welcome, fans!</h2><div class="meta">posted by the mod team</div>
  <p>{{ page.description }}. This is the number one fan spot for everything {{ page.category | lower }} in {{ page.village }}. Grab a headband and stay awhile!</p>
  <div class="tags"><span>
{% if link.characters is defined %}
 <div class="post spotlight"><h2>Character Spotlight</h2><div class="meta">community favorites</div>
{% for cname in link.characters %}
{% set prof = character_profiles[cname] %}
  <h3>{{ cname }}</h3>
{% if prof.jutsu %}  <ul>{% for j in prof.jutsu[:3] %}<li>{{ j }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{% endif %}{% for q in prof.quotes[:2] %}  <p class="quote">&ldquo;{{ q }}&rdquo;</p>
{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
 </div>
{% endif %}
 <div class="post"><h2>Top 10 moments this season</h2><div class="meta">3 days ago &middot; 1.2k likes</div>
  <p>From clutch mission saves to legendary training montages — our community voted, and the results are in. Drop your own favourites in the comments!</p></div>
 <div class="post"><h2>Fan art showcase</h2><div class="meta">1 week ago</div>
  <p>Incredible submissions this month. Keep them coming — best entry wins a signed (fake) headband.</p></div>
 <div class="post"><h2>Blogroll — friends of {{ page.village }}</h2><div class="meta">pinned</div>
  <div class="blogroll">
{% for r in related[:14] %}   <a href="http://{{ r }}/">{{ r }}</a>
{% endfor %}{% if related|length == 0 %}   <em>No links yet.</em>{% endif %}
  </div></div>
</div>
<footer>{{ page.url }} &middot; Fourth Great Ninja War (fan-made fiction).</footer>
</body></html>
